==Latin==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Classical}} {{IPA|/ˈdam.noː/|lang=la}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{term|damnum||damage, injury|lang=la}}.

====Verb====
{{la-verb|damno|damnō|damnare|damnāre|damnavi|damnāvī|damnatum|damnātum}}

# I [[discredit]], [[find]] [[fault]], [[disapprove]], [[reject]].
# {{context|of a will|lang=la}} I [[bind]], [[oblige]].
# {{legal|lang=la}} I [[sentence]] someone to a [[punishment]], [[declare]] [[guilty]], [[condemn]], [[doom]], [[convict]].
# {{context|in a non-legal context|lang=la}} I condemn, [[censure]], [[judge]].

